{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>puzzle game</strong> immerses you in a world where, every night, dreams and nightmares clash in an ancient struggle. As a field agent for the Bureau of Dreams, you must <strong>investigate</strong> a mysterious abandoned factory and uncover whether it is a secret hideout of the Nightmare Committee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If so, you will need to figure out how they manufacture nightmares and reverse their production to bring restful, peaceful nights to the entire world. All in the utmost secrecy, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observation</strong>, <strong>deduction</strong>, and <strong>hands-on investigation</strong> will be the keys to your adventure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3607450?t=1747743264","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607450/37abb2e476bae24b6562d82f9bdfe3e5f2084b24/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747743264","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607450/d580c9ea2187fd276666eaccadd7d7dbe8641387/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747743264","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3607450/d580c9ea2187fd276666eaccadd7d7dbe8641387/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747743264","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>puzzle game</strong> immerses you in a world where, every night, dreams and nightmares clash in an ancient struggle. As a field agent for the Bureau of Dreams, you must <strong>investigate</strong> a mysterious abandoned factory and uncover whether it is a secret hideout of the Nightmare Committee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If so, you will need to figure out how they manufacture nightmares and reverse their production to bring restful